* Edit 2: Add series inductor to input path for enhanced impedance transformation
L L0 VIN1 n0  ; series inductor
C C4 n0 n1
L L1 n1 n2
NMOS NM1 n2 n3 VSS VSS
C C1 n3 n4
PMOS PM1 n5 n4 VDD VDD
L L2 n5 n6
C C2 n6 VSS
C C3 n5 VOUT1
R R1 VDD n7
NMOS NM3 n7 n7 VSS VSS
R R2 n7 n3
PMOS PM2 n8 n8 VDD VDD
R R4 n8 VSS
R R5 n8 n4